<title>UK: Southampton football club chairman to retire.</title>
<headline>Southampton football club chairman to retire.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Southampton Leisure Holdings Plc said on Tuesday that Guy Askham was retiring as chairman of Southampton Football Club.</p>
<p>Rupert Lowe, the chairman of Southampton Leisure, will also become chairman of the football club from May 31, 1997.</p>
<p>Southampton Leisure was formerly known as Secure Retirement Plc before it bought the English Premiership soccer club for 10.01 million stg in December 1996.</p>
<p>-London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
